Description: Kūhaku (空白), a calm home for Claude
 A full screen home where you ask Claude and it does the work: the home screen,
 Mado (browser), Miru (files), Tegami (mail), Tsukuru (code), screenshots with
 markup, and the login and boot screens in the same quiet style.
